      <encoding-description>88-measure refined acoustic piano adaptation. Original upper-line register and rhythms retained; acoustic-source tempi 82, 83, 85, 80 BPM preserved. F-sharp-minor inner tones corrected, bass octave doubling revoiced and hand collisions removed. Editorial arrangement, not a new vocal transcription.</encoding-description>
    </encoding>
    <source>User-supplied piano screenshots and LAGOS - ROMA (Acústico).mp3. Two-measure fragment overlap reconciled as in prior acoustic transcription.</source>
